      "content": "hey so i started taking quetiapine (seroquel) for my sleep/anxiety stuff a few weeks ago and it works good but i still feel kinda wired at night. would it be okay if i took some diazepam (valium) too just to make sure i actually stay asleep? or is that too much?",
